From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gregor MacLennan <gmaclennan@awana.digital>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 19:20:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] doc,build: mobile notes and ignores

What a person browsing a release tag sees and what the dev loop needs:
the upstream README is replaced with a short pointer to the recipe
branch (the tag is a materialized tree, not the project), and
.gitignore learns the mobile build outputs so the regenerate loop's
git operations in a built tree never sweep them up.

Co-authored-by: Andre Staltz <andre@staltz.com>
---
 .gitignore | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index 74eb99c815..ce1c201ce9 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -38,6 +38,10 @@
 /*.exe
 /*.swp
 /out
+/out_android
+/out_ios
+/out_ios_*
+/out_testnode*
 /*.msi
 /*.wixpdb
 /*.qlog
@@ -87,6 +91,7 @@ _UpgradeReport_Files/
 /deps/icu-tmp
 ./node_modules
 /android-toolchain/
+/tools/ios-framework/bin/
 # generated by gyp on Windows
 /deps/openssl/openssl.props
 /deps/openssl/openssl.targets
